{"kind":"grammar","lang":"en","entities":{"n2-080":{"renderings":[{"id":"e57f4a2daa74e2a7","role":"prose","field":"shortExplanation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n2-080"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"Expresses that something cannot be endured, tolerated, or is unbearable."},{"id":"9255e44a38b072a9","role":"prose","field":"longExplanation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n2-080"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"The ～てかなわない grammar point is typically used with adjectives (or a rephrased verb) in 〜て form to show an unbearable situation or feeling. It means you 'can’t stand' or 'can’t endure' something. It often appears with expressions like 「暑くてかなわない」「うるさくてかなわない」 and so on."},{"id":"67817ea0c2b3b4fd","role":"prose","field":"formation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n2-080"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"Adjective (〜く / 〜で) + て + かなわない / Verb phrase (reworded to an adjective/negative) + て + かなわない"},{"id":"9ec03f9d63448c63","role":"prose","field":"usageNote","source":{"source":"gokan","ref":"n2-080"},"match":"id","status":"reviewed","value":"てかなわない: unbearably, a complaint (暑くてかなわない)."},{"id":"140b3ceb8a829c1f","role":"label","field":"family","source":{"source":"gokan","ref":"cant-help-but"},"match":"id","status":"reviewed","value":"Can't Help But (Overwhelming Feeling)","of":{"kind":"family","id":"cant-help-but"}}]},"n2-080#c4d7c548b9d0":{"renderings":[{"id":"fb24eb3507a9a33a","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n2-080"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"I can’t stand this heat."}]},"n2-080#2e925f7d7d3e":{"renderings":[{"id":"d9c60e553249642a","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n2-080"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"His remarks are so rude I can’t put up with them."}]},"n2-080#3b11f7427844":{"renderings":[{"id":"6ba53c93069592f4","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n2-080"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"The movie was so moving that I can’t stand how it stays on my mind."}]},"n2-080#ac2020ecb9ef":{"renderings":[{"id":"31b834173a31e89f","role":"translation","source":{"source":"hanabira","ref":"n2-080"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"Her smile is so dazzling that it’s overwhelming."}]}}}